      "observed": "Aerial actually inspected: pink-and-white diamond-inlaid upper western range, two open stacked arcades below, large pointed upper windows and projecting center balcony. Pale gray sheet-metal hips with Gothic pinnacles,open principal court and taller pale Renaissance canal range. Northern attached buildings meet the independent basilica;do not substitute a plain isolated rectangular shell."
